        <mxCell id="reflection" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=15;" value="&lt;b&gt;4 · Learning reflection (reuse your Discord paragraph)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As I modeled the process, I found that the information that we need to gather came to me in a way that was easy to understand. I found that in W05-S04 there was a lack of communication that resulted in a lapse of information. As I completed the assignment, I thought it was way more engaging than the Week 04 assignment because it involved drawing up the path." vertex="1">
